  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Found as a hatchling scavenging in the radioactive mud flats outside Subchain City, 'Choppy' Splinterbill learned to survive by any means necessary. The streets of Big Yoke Center are his hunting grounds, and rumors whisper he's a one-duck wrecking crew when DRIP is on the line.",
